<title>USA: Vari-L in $10 mln deal with Lucent.</title>
<headline>Vari-L in $10 mln deal with Lucent.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vari-L Co Inc said Monday that it has agreed to form a strategic alliance with at unit of Lucent Technologies Inc to manufacture and develop magnetic and electro-optic products .</p>
<p>As part of the proposed agreement, Lucent will make Vari-L its exclusive supplier of such products for the next two years, with an estimated value of $10 million in sales to Vari-L, it said.</p>
<p>The deal is with Lucent's optoelectronics unit.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
